  "id": "roasted-eggplant-and-bell-pepper-salad",
  "name": "Roasted Eggplant and Bell Pepper Salad",
  "subtitle": "A chilled salad of tender roasted vegetables and fresh herbs.",
  "description": "Eggplant, bell pepper, onion, and tomato are cooked with garlic and parsley, then cooled and chilled for a make-ahead vegetable salad.",
